{"4008170": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Underground Business", "steam_appid": 4008170, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cozy-Horror</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Underground Business is a cozy horror game where you work at a pizzeria and discover suspicious activity. Cook pizza and be ready to run for your life at any moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008170/extras/f8c9ba37b11efd22ea0fb36434619f48.poster.avif?t=1778491713\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008170/extras/f8c9ba37b11efd22ea0fb36434619f48.webm?t=1778491713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008170/extras/f8c9ba37b11efd22ea0fb36434619f48.mp4?t=1778491713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cook Pizza</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of pizzas will be ordered by your clients. Prepare your station and meticulously craft each pizza using physics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008170/extras/eb4ec2da80abac99bdf142634ac2ffdc.poster.avif?t=1778491713\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008170/extras/eb4ec2da80abac99bdf142634ac2ffdc.webm?t=1778491713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008170/extras/eb4ec2da80abac99bdf142634ac2ffdc.mp4?t=1778491713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Horror Event</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness abnormal activity coming from beneath your pizzeria. I wouldn’t go there if I were you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Run for your life</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Being a witness can be dangerous. Run and skate away from your threats in multiple high-intensity chases, don’t look back! Just kidding, do look back, it’s way more fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008170/extras/ef00708fa49d55b5e0a72abe9dd9a6d7.poster.avif?t=1778491713\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008170/extras/ef00708fa49d55b5e0a72abe9dd9a6d7.webm?t=1778491713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008170/extras/ef00708fa49d55b5e0a72abe9dd9a6d7.mp4?t=1778491713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cozy-Horror</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Underground Business is a cozy horror game where you work at a pizzeria and discover suspicious activity. Cook pizza and be ready to run for your life at any moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008170/extras/f8c9ba37b11efd22ea0fb36434619f48.poster.avif?t=1778491713\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008170/extras/f8c9ba37b11efd22ea0fb36434619f48.webm?t=1778491713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008170/extras/f8c9ba37b11efd22ea0fb36434619f48.mp4?t=1778491713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cook Pizza</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of pizzas will be ordered by your clients. Prepare your station and meticulously craft each pizza using physics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008170/extras/eb4ec2da80abac99bdf142634ac2ffdc.poster.avif?t=1778491713\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008170/extras/eb4ec2da80abac99bdf142634ac2ffdc.webm?t=1778491713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008170/extras/eb4ec2da80abac99bdf142634ac2ffdc.mp4?t=1778491713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Horror Event</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness abnormal activity coming from beneath your pizzeria. I wouldn’t go there if I were you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Run for your life</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Being a witness can be dangerous. Run and skate away from your threats in multiple high-intensity chases, don’t look back! Just kidding, do look back, it’s way more fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008170/extras/ef00708fa49d55b5e0a72abe9dd9a6d7.poster.avif?t=1778491713\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008170/extras/ef00708fa49d55b5e0a72abe9dd9a6d7.webm?t=1778491713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008170/extras/ef00708fa49d55b5e0a72abe9dd9a6d7.mp4?t=1778491713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Underground Business is a horror cooking game where you prepare orders for a rural town at a pizzeria kiosk. Take orders, cook pizza, investigate the suspicious pizzeria underground and run for your life in high-in